<title>BARBADOS: CRICKET-RED STRIPE CUP THIRD DAY SCORES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-RED STRIPE CUP THIRD DAY SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>BRIDGETOWN 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Close of play scores on the third day of four-day Red Stripe Cup cricket matches on Sunday:</p>
<p>In Bridgetown: Trinidad and Tobago 165 and 253. Barbados 238 and 32-2.</p>
<p>In Castries, St Lucia: Jamaica 77 and 184 (M.Morgan 4-33, R.Lewis 4-37). Windward Islands 104 and 0-0.</p>
<p>Georgetown: Guyana v Leeward Islands - No play because of rain.</p>
</text>
